── CROP SAFETY (${state.crop} crop) ────────
${getCropSafety(state.crop)}
 
── TEXT PLACEMENT (${state.emphasis} emphasis) ─
[ ] Reserve ${state.emphasis === 'center' ? 'top or bottom 30%' : state.emphasis === 'split' ? '50% one side'  : '40-50% ' + (state.emphasis === 'left' ? 'right' : 'left') + ' side'} for text graphics
[ ] Text contrast ratio ≥ 4.5:1 against BG
